<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Jira on Nick's blog</title><link>https://blog.nickwu.fun/tags/jira/</link><description>Recent content in Jira on Nick's blog</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.nickwu.fun/tags/jira/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>分发工作也要第二轮：按负载和影响面再平衡</title><link>https://blog.nickwu.fun/post/nforce-jiraassist-rebalance/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 21:10:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.nickwu.fun/post/nforce-jiraassist-rebalance/</guid><description>规则文件的第一轮分配只会「按组件找人」：一条规则命中 30 张就把 30 张全给同一个人。第二轮按每个人手头的实际负载（带 impact 权重）重新分，而且只在移动真的能缩小差距时才动手。</description></item><item><title>nForce-JiraAssist：把默认连接指向团队自己的 Jira</title><link>https://blog.nickwu.fun/post/nforce-jiraassist-default-connection/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 20:50:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://blog.nickwu.fun/post/nforce-jiraassist-default-connection/</guid><description>设置页第一屏不再是一片空白：站点、部署类型和认证方式都按团队的实际环境预填好，而且是唯一不落任何凭据的组合——浏览器会话。</description></item></channel></rss>